  "bodyHash": "8h9EdjrBh4w=",
  "content": "<h1>补充光影补丁</h1><p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplemental-patches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" style=\"padding-left:5px\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplemental-patches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" style=\"padding-left:5px\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/jedlimlx/supplemental-patches/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/documentation/issues_vector.svg\" alt=\"问题追踪\" style=\"padding-left:5px\"></a>\n</p><p><img src=\"https://supplemental-patches.pages.dev/assets/banner.png\">\n<br>\n补充光影补丁允许用户通过资源包为模组方块、实体、物品、粒子等创建自定义着色器。本模组默认内置支持众多热门模组的资源包。</p><p>如果安装了<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Euphoria Patches</a>，这些额外着色器将自动注入其中。</p><h2>功能特点</h2><p>模组最<em>令人兴奋</em>的功能包括（针对玩家）：</p><ul>\n<li>为各类热门模组（如<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjadens-nether-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">杰德的下界扩展</a>）提供超过500种高质量自定义材质着色器。完整列表请见<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsupplemental-patches.pages.dev%252fmod_list\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</li>\n<li>基于<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenderscape\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">末地之境</a>氛围设计的自定义末地星云天空盒</li>\n<li>基于<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdoom-gloom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">末日与昏暗</a>效果的酷炫雾效</li>\n<li>修复多个模组的着色器问题（如<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fendergetic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">末地激变</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fupgrade-aquatic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">水域升级</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdoom-gloom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">末日与昏暗</a>）</li>\n<li>修复方块实体上物品着色器的渲染问题（如<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a>的展示台、物品架）</li>\n</ul><p>关于可注入Euphoria Patches的受支持区域详情，请参阅此<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsupplemental-patches.pages.dev%252ftutorials%252fgetting_started\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">教程</a>。</p><h2>常见问题</h2><p><strong>问：</strong> 会移植到(Neo)Forge和Fabric以外的加载器吗？<br>\n<strong>答：</strong> 大概率不会。</p><p><strong>问：</strong> 会向后兼容旧版本吗？<br>\n<strong>答：</strong> 大概率不会。</p><p><strong>问：</strong> 能支持XXX模组吗？<br>\n<strong>答：</strong> 请耐心等待。您也可以自行添加支持，详情请参考此<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsupplemental-patches.pages.dev%252ftutorials%252fgetting_started\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">教程</a>。</p><p><strong>问：</strong> 我发现了一个bug。<br>\n<strong>答：</strong> 请先向我报告，不要打扰Complementary Shaders/Euphoria Patches的开发者。</p><p><strong>问：</strong> 我添加的着色器没有显示。<br>\n<strong>答：</strong> 确保资源包已加载后，尝试重新加载着色器包。或者使用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252feuphoria-companion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Euphoria Companion</a>模组检查方块的渲染层级。某些方块（如特定玻璃方块）可能以镂空而非半透明方式渲染，需要通过<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsupplemental-patches.pages.dev%252fdocumentation%252fproperties.json\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">block.properties.json</a>调整其渲染层级。</p><p><strong>问：</strong> 内置着色器不生效。<br>\n<strong>答：</strong> 同样请尝试重新加载着色器包，并确保内置资源包已加载。</p><p><strong>问：</strong> 支持Optifine吗？<br>\n<strong>答：</strong> 不支持。仅兼容Oculus/Iris。</p><p><strong>问：</strong> 可以加入我的整合包吗？<br>\n<strong>答：</strong> 当然可以，请随意使用。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
